{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every suitcase in the scene, it is positioned on the left side. To the right of the suitcase is a pan. Directly above the pan is a bottle, and directly below the pan is a plate; these three objects (bottle, pan, plate) are aligned vertically. An apple is placed to the right of the bottle. A pair of glasses is located to the right of the pan, and the glasses are smaller than the pan. A fork is positioned to the right of the plate. Finally, a watch is located below the fork and is situated on the right side of the image.",
